  \resources\SetSurfaceHubWSUSServer_UnableToUpdateWSUSServer:
    Candidate Language=KM-KH: មិនអាចអាប់ដេតការកំណត់ម៉ាស៊ូនមេ WSUS
  \resources\SetSurfaceHubWSUSServer_serverUrlPlaceHolderText:
